\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Starts Weaker Awaiting Govt  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2003\par 13:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real opened weaker against the dollar Monday amid continued expectations that the Treasury will snap up dollars through the end of the year.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened at BRL2.873 per dollar, compared with Friday's BRL2.869 close.  \par \par \uc2 The real is widely predicted to weaken through December to BRL3.00 to the dollar as the Treasury bolsters reserves and the private sector's foreign debt comes due. Traders said Banco do Brasil was buying in substantial volume last week on the Treasury's behalf, and they expected steady dollar purchases to continue. Local companies have begun entering the market as well, grabbing greenbacks while they're still cheap to pay debt expiring at the end of the year.  \par \par \uc2 However, strong dollar inflows continue to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  afloat. The market now sees the real ending November at BRL2.91 per dollar, stronger than the previous prediction of BRL2.94, according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weekly survey.  \par \par \uc2 Supporting the real, the private sector is continuing to close new foreign debt deals, as Brazil becomes a safer haven for investment dollars.  \par \par \uc2 The market is waiting for companies including Usiminas, Cosipa and Banco BMG to bring in bond-sale money, and a new one-year accord signed this week with the International Monetary Fund is further improving perceptions of Brazil's risk, paving the way for local companies to place more bonds abroad.  \par \par \uc2 -By Hannah Karp, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511-3145-1479; brazil@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 1156 1843  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020031110dzba000ll\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
