\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Real Ends At BRL3.610/Dlr Vs BRL3.760 End Mon \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2002\par 21:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- A threat of big \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real rally for a second-straight day Tuesday, preventing losses for a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that has been battered by worries about a win Sunday by left-wing presidential candidate Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva. \par \par \uc2  After a 3.1% rally in the previous session on big dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real finished 4.1% stronger Tuesday at BRL3.610 per dollar, compared with BRL3.760 per dollar at Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  Traders said rumors throughout the day that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at anytime pushed the real stronger. After the real's close, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "There were lots of rumors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but there was no evidence of selling until late in the day," said one Sao Paulo trader. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in addition to a sale of export credit lines and debt buybacks held to stabilize bond and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  prices. \par \par \uc2  According to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data, at least $162 million was spent on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday, though some analysts put the number at as much as $300 million. \par \par \uc2  Besides the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , there is also a sense here among some commentators that the real is grossly undervalued and that a Lula presidency would be less dangerous than some investors would believe. \par \par \uc2  Roberto Setubal, the head of banking giant Banco Itau SA (ITU), Monday said Lula would be a pragmatist as president, rather than a left-wing ideologue. He also said market jitters shouldn't be allowed to impact the presidential transition. \par \par \uc2  Later Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monetary Policy Director Luiz Fernando Figueiredo is slated to hold a press conference on plans for debt rollovers and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Terry Wade, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511.3145.1479; terry.wade@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020021001dya10016e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
