\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Real Ends At BRL3.205/Dlr Vs BRL3.165 End Tue \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 August 2002\par 21:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- Though the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the spot market, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real ended weaker Wednesday as a lackluster sale of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2   swaps pressured the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , along with worries about the outcome of October presidential elections and a lack of export financing for local companies. \par \par \uc2  The real finished at BRL3.205 per dollar, about 1.2% weaker than BRL3.165 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  During the session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $24 million in Oct. 1 \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps at a linear rate of 28.5%. Though it rejected many bids, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was hoping to sell as much as $800 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps Wednesday to complete the rollover of a batch of $2.5 billion in dollar-linked debt set to mature Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Between Monday and Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $1.5 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps. If the rollovers aren't completed, hedging instruments currently in the market will expire and likely force the real to weaken. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed after the market closed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Wednesday. As is customary, it didn't say how many dollars it sold. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  five times on the market Wednesday but were unable to estimate the volume of dollars sold to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Governor Arminio Fraga discontinued daily \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par last week, though he said he would act to affect the market's direction\par or provide liquidity as necessary.\par    -By Terry Wade, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511.3145.1479;\par terry.wade@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020020814dy8e00b41\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
