\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Fraga says daily  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  over. \b0\par\par\uc2 202 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 August 2002\par 17:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will stop its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as of now, with future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out as necessary to stabilize the nation's battered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Arminio Fraga said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The end of daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after Latin America's largest economy won a $30 billion loan from the International Monetary Fund, sending the real, stocks and bonds sharply higher after weeks of slumps on investor nervousness ahead of October presidential elections. \par \par \uc2  Under the IMF accord, the allowed floor on Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves was cut to $5 billion from $15 billion, giving the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  a much larger war chest to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said that under the IMF deal, if \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeds $3 billion in any 30-day period, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to hold a "dialogue" with the IMF. \par \par \uc2  Through July, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been selling $50 million a day in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in an effort to halt the slide of the real, which continued to fall to record lows at the end of last month. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020808dy8800txu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
