\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2 , Sells Dollars - Dealers \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2002\par 20:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Brazil came to the real's rescue during late trading Thursday, after a Moody's announcement that it may downgrade the country's risk rating in the near future sparked a sell-off in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Primary dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars on the spot market, in lots of $10 million each. An estimated $100 million was sold, said the dealers. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the third of the kind since Friday, did little to aid the embattled Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which so far this month has lost nearly 10% of its value. \par \par \uc2  At around 1900 GMT, the real was changing hands at BRL2.775 to the dollar, little changed from the weak point of the day at BRL2.778. \par \par \uc2  "It seemed that the more the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold, the more the market asked for," said a Sao Paulo-based trader. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily on the market since last Friday, selling dollars on the spot market and doing dollar repo agreements. Also, the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been swapping long- and medium-term domestic public debt for short-term securities in a bid to calm tension. The country also drew down $10 billion from an existing International Monetary Fund facility to shore up confidence. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11 3145-1481 adriana.arai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020620dy6k0014b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
