\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Malan:  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Only For Extreme Cases \b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 2002\par 20:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister Pedro Malan on Monday said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market should be limited to extreme situations, as there is always a risk that the market will misinterpret the move as an attempt to target a "desired" exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  In a speech during a seminar on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  independence here, Malan added that \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "may be necessary at times when the market is taken by herd mentality...one way or the other, leading to an overshooting." \par \par \uc2  "I think there's a consensus that it (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) should be an exception rather than a rule... One must avoid the perception that there's an alternative (\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) regime...in which the government would secretly set a band within which the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would move, a desired exchange rate around which the government would try to carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Malan. \par \par \uc2  His comments follow a turbulent week when the Brazilian real lost 13 centavos, or 5% of its value, to BRR2.64 to the dollar. The sudden depreciation was sparked by a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move to improve transparency in mutual funds ended up exacerbating jitters about a possible victory of a left-wing candidate in the October presidential election. \par \par \uc2  Now traders said the real has temporarily stabilized at around BRR2.640. Yet many market players said they expect some sort of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakens again. \par \par \uc2  Malan also urged all presidential candidates to clarify their positions about economic policy to help calm market jitters. \par \par \uc2  "Some parties are against the fiscal responsibility law, saying it's incompatible with social responsibility," he said, noting that "saying such things is irresponsible." \par \par \uc2  Members of the Workers' Party - its candidate leading the polls ahead of the presidential vote - have said that inflation targets have equal standing with social targets. \par \par \uc2  Investors fear that, if faced with large budget constraints, the left would seek debt renegotiation or cut interest rates very quickly to be able to boost public spending. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't independent in Brazil and the next president will have the authority to nominate a new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor. \par \par \uc2  By Paula Lace and Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11 3145-1481; brazil@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020610dy6a00126\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
