\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2 ; Offering Dlr-Pegged Debt \b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Mai 2002\par 19:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered dollar-pegged debt and other securities to primary \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers in an unscheduled midafternoon sale Monday, in a move that was initially interpreted by some traders as an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the sagging real. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's open-market trading desk couldn't promptly provide the terms of the debt auction, but an official there confirmed that dollar-linked securities were on offer. \par \par \uc2  Later, the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading desk and a primary dealer said the offering wasn't an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and shouldn't have an impact on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The offering - involving a series of dollar-linked maturities and floating-rate LFT bills - has to do with an intraday discount \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  that one institution failed to settle within the proper hours Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Regardless of the reasons for the dollar-debt sale, the Brazilian real strengthened slightly to BRR2.431 to the dollar from BRR2.437 in wake of the debt sale news. \par \par \uc2  The real closed Friday at BRR2.409, its worst finish in about 10 weeks. Monday's weakness reflects political jitters ahead of the October presidential election. \par \par \uc2  Since that one institution failed to settle the intraday discount transaction Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended up sitting on a number of public securities that the institution provided as guarantee for the discount credit line. The institution took the discount funds and gave the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  the public securities, but it failed to pay back the money and get back the guarantee. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said the offering Monday simply was aimed at giving these securities back to the market. \par \par \uc2  He added that some market players thought it was an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  sale because the offering was unexpected, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to call many dealers to explain what was going on. \par \par \uc2  The Brazilian real has come under pressure in the last several sessions amid an outlook of weakening economic indicators and jitters among some investors about left-wing presidential candidate Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva's continued strength in polls for the October vote. \par \par \uc2  -Adriana Arai and Terry Wade, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511-3145-1479; brazil@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020506dy560014v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
